msgstr "آیا مقدار میانگین محاسبه شود؟"

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Descriptive Statistics) <settings> <setting>
#. (refers to element labelled "Trim of mean")
#: rkward/plugins/descriptive/descriptive_statistics.rkh:25
#, kde-format
